WEBVTT

00:00:03.514 --> 00:00:05.559
It always <b>snows</b> here in the winter.

00:00:06.046 --> 00:00:07.695
Look! It’<b>s snowing</b>.

00:00:10.049 --> 00:00:12.306
What <b>do you</b> usually <b>do</b> at work?

00:00:13.125 --> 00:00:14.417
What <b>are you doing</b> now?

00:00:16.625 --> 00:00:18.421
My sister <b>works</b> in a bank.

00:00:18.987 --> 00:00:20.853
Today she’<b>s working</b> at home.